VALUES (NULL, NULL, 138722, 'Distant Worlds 2', 'Distant Worlds 2', 'game', 2022, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co300c.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arza8.jpg', 'Distant Worlds 2 is a vast, pausable real-time 4X space strategy game. Experience the full depth and detail of turn-based strategy, but with the simplicity and ease of real-time, and on the scale of a massively-multiplayer online game. The Universe is Yours!

Huge Galaxies with up to 2,000 star systems and tens of thousands of planets, moons and asteroids are yours to explore and exploit, whether peacefully through mining and diplomacy or by conquest! The complex process of generating a galaxy ensures that every new game will be different and the many galaxy setup options ensure incredible replayability as well as the ability to have your game be just the way you like it.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/distant-worlds-2', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 9.03, '2026-11-23 15:29:50', '2026-11-23 15:29:50')
