VALUES (NULL, NULL, 17030, 'LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens', 'LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wnc.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arkxw.jpg', 'LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens takes players deeper into the new film than any other game with all of the heroic characters from the movie, including Rey, Finn, Poe Dameron, Han Solo, Chewbacca, C-3PO, and BB-8, as well as Kylo Ren, General Hux and Captain Phasma, while also exploring iconic Star Wars locales, such as Jakku and Starkiller Base.

This game introduces new gameplay features, including the enhanced “Multi-Builds” system, where players can choose from multiple building options to advance the game. Gamers will be able to engage in intense new Blaster Battles for the first time, utilizing surrounding environments to drive back the First Order. Fans can also experience the thrill of high-speed flight gameplay through arena-based battles and dogfights in space, while utilizing a multitude of vehicles along the way, including the legendary Millennium Falcon.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/lego-star-wars-the-force-awakens', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation 4", "Nintendo 3DS", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac", "Wii U", "PlayStation Vita", "Xbox 360", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.1, 0, 7.53, '2026-11-23 15:29:50', '2026-11-23 15:29:50')
