VALUES (NULL, NULL, 323536, 'Light of Motiram', 'Light of Motiram', 'game', 2027, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co949n.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar37tl.jpg', 'Light of Motiram is an open-world survival game where you explore a world overrun by colossal machines, explore the vast open world, build your base of operations, advance technology, train Mechanimals, and take on formidable bosses. Starting from the primitive age, forge a new path of development. Defy the machination, survive with mechanimals.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/light-of-motiram--1', '["Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 7.02, '2026-11-23 15:29:50', '2026-11-23 15:29:50')
